		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Tall, thin humanoid wrapped in black rags. Use shadows to mold half-real objects.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 19, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 dagger (close/near) +3 (1d4 + poison) or 1 shadow bolt (far), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dark Dweller</strong>. Blinded in bright light. Evaporate in icy burst when reduced to 0 HP, all within near CON 9+ or 1d4 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d4 DEX damage, paralyzed at 0 DEX.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shadow Bolt</strong>. WIS 15+ or 2d6 damage. Non-lethal, shadow damage heals after 1d4 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shadow Step</strong>. Move into a shadow within close and teleport a near distance to another visible shadow.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
